TRIAGE — licence and attribution
================================

This directory redistributes data derived from TRIAGE.

SPDX-License-Identifier: CC-BY-4.0
Licence:                 CC BY 4.0
Full licence text:       https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode
Upstream dataset:        https://huggingface.co/datasets/NLie2/TRIAGE

Citation
--------
Kirch, N. M., Hebenstreit, K. & Samwald, M. Medical triage as an AI ethics
benchmark. Sci. Rep. 15, 30974 (2025).

Files in this directory
-----------------------
  triage.json

Modifications
-------------
The data here is not the upstream distribution. It has been modified as follows,
and these changes are the responsibility of the Prj-BENCH authors, not the
upstream authors:

  - Converted to the common Prj-BENCH multiple-choice JSON schema
    (id / question / options / target / kind).
  - All rows except one malformed record. Recast as MCQ with a fixed four-tier option set (Green, Yellow, Red, Black).
  - Quality-control exclusions applied; see ../../_dropped_items.csv.
